title: 'staking-async runtimes: fix treasury payout XCM location and waive its delivery
  fees'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    The parachain runtime hardcoded the treasury's interior location to pallet index 37, copied from the relay runtime, while its Treasury pallet sits at index 96. Derive the index from `PalletInfoAccess` in both staking-async runtimes.

    `PayOverXcm` charges delivery fees from that location before sending the payout XCM. No location converter maps a local pallet location to an account, so the withdrawal failed and every payout errored before leaving the chain. Add the location to `WaivedLocations` in both runtimes, as #10831 did for the relay and collectives runtimes, and pin it with a test.
crates: []
